<title>UK: TABLE - BAA Q1 pretax profit up 4.5 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE - BAA Q1 pretax profit up 4.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		10.1		   vs  9.5</p>
<p> Pretax		     136		    vs 130</p>
<p> Revenue		    367		    vs 347</p>
<p> Operating profit	 147		    vs 139</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 134 and 140 million stg. Profit after tax and after windfall tax of 102 million stg was 3.0 million stg versus 98 million. Earnings per share after windfall tax was 0.3 pence versus 9.5 pence.</p>
<p>Full company name - BAA Plc.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
